    <other_details id="References">Archetypes: openEHR-DEMOGRAPHIC-GROUP.care_team.v1, openEHR-EHR-CLUSTER.electronic_communication.v1. Aligned with the HL7 FHIR R4 (4.0.1) resource CareTeam (https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/); the categories are its care-team-category codes, bound to LOINC.</other_details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>en</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>A care team: its names, identifiers, status, categories, period, reasons and electronic contacts.</purpose>
      <keywords>care team</keywords>
      <keywords>team</keywords>
      <keywords>group</keywords>
      <use>Use for a care team as a party. The team holds no relationships: members record a membership of the team, and patients a care relationship to it, in their own parties.</use>
      <misuse>Not for an organisation or a department with a legal or administrative standing.</misuse>
      <copyright>© openehr-reference-content contributors</copyright>
    </details>
  </description>
